@baseUrl = http://localhost:5019

### Register an account; confirm the emailed token before login.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"store.owner","email":"owner@example.com","password":"Replace-with-a-unique-password-593!"}

### Login and use the returned access token as a bearer token on business routes.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"store.owner","password":"Replace-with-a-unique-password-593!"}

### Account operations and business roles are documented in README.md and docs/.
